{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00200","headline":"暮春喜雨诗 · 文宗皇帝","name":"暮春喜雨诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风云喜际会，雷雨遂流滋。\n荐币虚陈礼，动天实精思。\n渐侵九夏节，复在三春时。\n霢霂垂朱阙，飘颻入绿墀。\n郊垧既沾足，黍稷有丰期。\n百辟同康乐，万方伫雍熙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}